: "other", "lines": [[77, 77]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 62, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[78, 78]], "assertion": "yellow cards per game was included as a covariate, a proxy for playing style/aggressiveness", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["yellow cards per game"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [63]}, {"id": 63, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[78, 78]], "assertion": "results were presented both with and without the yellow-cards-per-game adjustment because it could be confounder or mediator", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["yellow cards per game"], "confidence": "medium", "shares_lines_with": [62]}, {"id": 64, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[79, 79]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 65, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[80, 80]], "assertion": "age (in 2012) was included as a standard demographic control", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["age"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 66, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[81, 81]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 67, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[82, 82]], "assertion": "height was included as a covariate", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["height"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 68, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[83, 83]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 69, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[84, 84]], "assertion": "weight was included as a covariate", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["weight"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 70, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "other", "lines": [[85, 85]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 71, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[86, 86]], "note": "Model Specification subheading"}, {"id": 72, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[87, 92]], "assertion": "a linear probability model was fitted via OLS with player-clustered standard errors, using the formula P(anyRedCard) = β0+β1(darkSkin)+β2(position)+β3(leagueCountry)+β4(games)+β5(yellowPerGame)+β6(age)+β7(height)+β8(weight)+ε", "